# ORCA 6.1 single-point energy with implicit solvent.
# Example using CPCM. Consult the ORCA 6.1 implicit-solvation section for SMD solvent support/settings.
! wB97X-D3 def2-TZVPP TightSCF CPCM(Acetonitrile) SP

%pal nprocs 8 end
%maxcore 2000

* xyz 0 1
C  0.000000  0.000000  0.000000
H  0.000000  0.000000  1.090000
H  1.027000  0.000000 -0.363000
H -0.513000 -0.889000 -0.363000
H -0.513000  0.889000 -0.363000
*
